3](https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66e8617ff9cbf43e43b040ef/6727bf0b-9395-4e66-ab15-beb33eb3c3f6/03_sanctuary
_ai_phoenix_gen_7_back_not_a_render.jpg)\n\nSanctuary AI presents the eighth generation of its Phoenix general purpose AI 
humanoid robots. This new generation of Phoenix robots is optimized for capturing high quality data, with improvements to 
field of view and telemetry systems, and enhanced person-robot interaction. Phoenix Generation 8 was also designed with 
manufacturing in mind, with additional improvements in bill of materials costs and the simplicity of its design, making it 
quicker to commission and build.\n\n![Image 
4](https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66e8617ff9cbf43e43b040ef/b2e59bb7-ed6f-4b25-8ab2-7fcb08ebf1ac/09_sanctuary
