 \"faulhaber-motors-for-humanoids\")\n\n# Sanctuary AI Unveils the Next Generation of AI Robotics\n\n![HRT 
Badge](https://humanoidroboticstechnology.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/HRT-Badge-v1.0-24x24.png)\n![Sanctuary AI Gen 
7](https://humanoidroboticstechnology.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Sanctuary-AI-Gen-7.jpg)\n\n**Sanctuary AI, dedicated 
to pioneering the world’s first human-like intelligence in general-purpose robots, has introduced the seventh generation of
its general-purpose robot, Phoenix™. This latest iteration, alongside its AI control system, Carbon™, approaches human-like
capabilities even more closely, featuring significant enhancements to both hardware and AI software. The unveiling follows 
